This product is a Cangjie (仓颉) ETSI TS 119 6x2 consultation / LoTE / PKIX
module for the EU Digital Identity Wallet on HarmonyOS.

The interface surface is a Cangjie port of the EU Digital Identity Wallet
Kotlin Multiplatform library:

    eudi-lib-kmp-etsi-1196x2
    Copyright (c) European Commission
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
    https://github.com/eu-digital-identity-wallet/eudi-lib-kmp-etsi-1196x2

This product depends on and/or bundles the following third-party software:

  - cangjie-stdx (Apache License 2.0) — Cangjie extended standard library;
    stdx.crypto.x509, stdx.encoding.json, and stdx.net.http back certificate,
    JSON, and HTTP paths. Bundled under entry/libs/stdx/.

  - OpenSSL runtime libraries (libcrypto_openssl.z.so, libssl_openssl.z.so)
    and libsecurec.so, bundled under entry/libs/arm64-v8a/ for on-device
    execution of stdx.crypto (loaded via dlopen at runtime).

